  "releaseNotes": "Refactor handshake API and add async Connect methods:\n      - Simplify and centralize handshake and connection logic: removed CancellationTokenSource/Task parameters from HandleHandshake and updated all callers to use the new parameterless API.\n      - Introduced PreConnect() to reuse disconnect/spin-wait logic and added several ConnectAsync overloads (IPEndPoint, IPAddress, address+port, DnsEndPoint) for convenience.\n      - Hardened cancellation with _cts?.Cancel and extracted SSL handshake steps in SslClient into PrepareHandshake, PreHandshake and PostHandshake helpers; updated SslClientAuthenticationOptions (client certificates, encryption policy) and removed legacy async callback code.\n      - Also updated SslSession to match the new HandleHandshake signature.",
